Thirty
⎕←'Date Produced: ' , ¯4↓⎕ts

:If ((30+⎕ts[3])>31) ∧ ((⎕ts[2]=1)∨(⎕ts[2]=3)∨(⎕ts[2]=5)∨(⎕ts[2]=7)∨(⎕ts[2]=8)∨(⎕ts[2]=10))

⎕← 'Date of expiration: ' , ⎕ts[1], (1+⎕ts[2]), ((30+⎕ts[3])-31)

:ElseIf ((⎕ts[2]=4)∨(⎕ts[2]=6)∨(⎕ts[2]=9)∨(⎕ts[2]=11))
⎕←  'Date of expiration: ' , ⎕ts[1], (1+⎕ts[2]), ⎕ts[3]
:ElseIf (⎕ts[2]=2) ∧ ((0=4|⎕ts[1])=0)
⎕←'Date of expiration: ' , ⎕ts[1], (1+⎕ts[2]), ((30+⎕ts[3])-28)
:ElseIf (⎕ts[2]=2) ∧ ((0=4|⎕ts[1])=1)
⎕←'Date of expiration: ' , ⎕ts[1], (1+⎕ts[2]), ((30+⎕ts[3])-29)
:ElseIf ((1+⎕ts[3])>31) ∧ (⎕ts[2]=12)
⎕←'Date of expiration: ' , (⎕ts[1]+1), (⎕ts[2]-11), ((30+⎕ts[3])-31)
:Else
⎕←'Date of Expiration: ' , ⎕ts[1], ⎕ts[2], (30+ ⎕ts[3])
:EndIf
